Speech_0198L=GEN SOLDIER - Time to target. Ten. Nine. Eight. Seven. Six. Five. Four. Three. Two. One.
Speech_0199L=GEN SOLDIER - Impact. It's a hit!
Speech_0200L=GEN SOLDIER - Time to target. Ten. Nine. Eight... ah... missile destroyed. Repeat... missile destroyed.
Speech_0201L=GEN SOLDIER - Ah! Missile aborted! What?
