Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0144L=NKSOLD_A - The Russian cosmonaut just attempted a space walk to repair the exterior oxygen leak on the ISS.
Speech_0145L=NKSOLD_B - They don't have gear for a spacewalk... what the heck we're they thinking?
Speech_0146L=NKSOLD_A - I don't think they had much choice.
Speech_0147L=NKSOLD_B - So what happened?
Speech_0148L=NKSOLD_A - He slipped off into space.
Speech_0149L=NKSOLD_B - What?
Speech_0150L=NKSOLD_A - Yeah. He sang 'Slavsa Otechestvo nashe svobodnoye' for a while, then just turned off his radio and drifted out of sight.
Speech_0151L=NKSOLD_B - Wow. I'm glad we're fighting Americans...
Speech_0152L=NKSOLD_A - Why?
Speech_0153L=NKSOLD_B - Because Russians are tough.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0154L=NKSOLD_C - I'm scared... what do we do when the Americans come?
Speech_0155L=NKSOLD_D - I'll tell you... there's three things you don't want to forget when it all goes down.
Speech_0156L=NKSOLD_C - What?
Speech_0157L=NKSOLD_D - First...if you're inside when they come... get outside as fast as possible. They'll drop bunker busters. Anybody underground will die.
Speech_0158L=NKSOLD_C - Okay... get outside... got it.
Speech_0159L=NKSOLD_D - Second... if you're outside when they come, get inside as fast as possible. They'll be raining precision munitions on us... you'll be dead before you know you're being shot at.
Speech_0160L=NKSOLD_C - Uh... okay... so... don't be outside and don't be inside.
Speech_0161L=NKSOLD_D - Exactly... and the third thing...
Speech_0162L=NKSOLD_C - What's the third thing?
Speech_0163L=NKSOLD_D - When you die... try not to get blood on me... ha!
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0164L=NKSOLD_E - Ow... these boots are killing me.
Speech_0165L=NKSOLD_F - Yeah, I know what you mean. I got a new pair two months ago and my feet still hurt.
Speech_0166L=NKSOLD_E - Did you figure out any way to break them in faster?
Speech_0167L=NKSOLD_F - No. But I sure know what not to do. I heard one guy in Fourth Platoon a few years ago... he complained to the company medic... and they cut his foot off.
Speech_0168L=NKSOLD_E - What?!
Speech_0169L=NKSOLD_F - No one's complained about their boots since.
Speech_0170L=NKSOLD_E - Oh... well... I'm not going to be the first.

