[P_07_Battery_ConvoGarage]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=HO - Hey, Feng... You said there were eight crates in the delivery... but I only see seven.
Speech_0004L=FENG - What do you mean, seven?
Speech_0005L=HO - As in one less than eight.
Speech_0006L=FENG - Well the bill of lading said there were eight.
Speech_0007L=HO - Did you count?
Speech_0008L=FENG - Uh... well... not exactly...
Speech_0009L=HO - Not exactly?  It's just not that hard to count eight giant crates... look... I'll double check... but if you screwed this up... I'm gonna have to report you.

[P_07_Battery_ConvoMissileBay_01]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=CHIN - Alright... Tercom. Database online...check. Terrain mapping active radar... check. Co-ordinate mapping subsystem... check. Co-ordinate cross-checker... check. Inertial displacement tracker... hmm... no that's right... check. Casing secure... check.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0004L=CHIN - Okay... IGS and GPS... Let's see... inertial gyroscope... check. Accelerometer... check. Barometric calibrator... check. GPS sequencer... check. Network receiver... check. Okay... good.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0005L=CHIN - And... Terminal Guidance... DSMAC... check. Image correlator... check. Active image mapper... check. Target tracking... check. Thermal imaging... check. Arming receiver... check. And fusing... check...
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0006L=CHIN - bored... blah... blah...

[P_07_Battery_ConvoWarehouse]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=PING - Alright...well, that's our work done. Let the control room take over.
Speech_0004L=PONG - Who's in the control room?
Speech_0005L=PING - How should I know?
Speech_0006L=PONG - So, what... we're just going to leave the missile hanging there.
Speech_0007L=PING - Orders: deliver cargo to loading bay at facility 27-290. Nothing in there about working a bunch of cranes that we're not trained on.
Speech_0008L=PONG - Fair enough.

