[P_07_Battery_GPlayCmdCenter]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0006L=YUAN - Sir, we... we have finished our preliminary inspection of the West Launcher.
Speech_0001L=KWAN - And what is your report, Captain?
Speech_0018L=YUAN - We ran every test we could, sir.
Speech_0010L=KWAN - And?
Speech_0011L=YUAN - And... well... there was no malfunction, sir.
Speech_0012L=KWAN - No malfunction... hm... curious. There is an eighty-billion dollar warship on the bottom of the sea, sunk by a missile that left this battery. The world is less than twelve hours from a war that will kill millions of people... and you're telling me that there was no malfunction?
Speech_0015L=YUAN - We checked everything, sir. I assure you...
Speech_0016L=KWAN - Well, Captain, the only two people in this building who could authorize that launch without approval are you and I. I know I didn't do it...so if it wasn't a malfunction...
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0004L=KWAN - I want you to run every test again, and then run whichever test the Captain forgot until you find out what the hell happened with my missile!
Speech_0005L=SHEN - Sir! Yes Sir!
Speech_0017L=KWAN - Get out of my sight...

