[P_07_Battery_GPlayMissileBay]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=SOO - Aw...forget this... let's go get a coffee.
Speech_0002L=DUCK - Good idea...
Speech_0003L=DUCK - Wait... aren't you going to lock-up the warhead casing?
Speech_0004L=SOO - Aw... forget that... the procedure takes ten minutes... we'll be back from our break before then.
Speech_0005L=DUCK - But someone could activate the arming sequence...
Speech_0006L=SOO - Ha! Ridiculous! Who would do that?
Speech_0007L=DUCK - I don't know... but--
Speech_0008L=SOO - And even if someone did... unless they could override the code locks...
Speech_0009L=DUCK - I guess you're right.
Speech_0010L=SOO - Of course I'm right. Now let's go get that coffee.
Note_0011L=You can activate the arming sequence on uncased missiles.

