[P_07_Battery_InteroBatteryEast]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0003L=FISHER - Don't bother struggling... it'll hurt more.
Speech_0004L=YONG - Who are you...
Speech_0005L=FISHER - I'm the guy who's going to abort that missile before it does any damage. You're the guy who's gonna tell me how.
Speech_0006L=YONG - Y... you need to get the abort codes from the launch computer. Then... since you don't have authorization, you'll have to bypass the override circuit on the launcher itself.
Speech_0007L=FISHER - Thanks... and if you shoot anymore missiles today, I'll come back and shoot you.
Speech_0008L=YONG - I won't... I promise
Speech_0016L=YONG - We won't do it again... I promise.
Speech_0017L=YONG - Please... we're just following orders.

[P_07_Battery_InteroBatteryWest]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=FISHER - The missile that sank the Walsh... it came from here... didn't it?
Speech_0002L=HWAN - Wha! Ah! Who?
Speech_0003L=FISHER - Answer me! Did the missile come from this launcher?
Speech_0004L=HWAN - Y...yes... but it wasn't our fault...
Speech_0005L=FISHER - I gathered that... but my friends are still dead.
Speech_0006L=HWAN - We... tried to stop it...
Speech_0007L=FISHER - You didn't do a very good job.
Speech_0008L=HWAN - Ugh... please... you're hurting me...
Speech_0009L=FISHER - I know.
Speech_0010L=HWAN - I'm... I'm sorry for your friends...
Speech_0011L=FISHER - You apologize to them... here... let me introduce you.
Speech_0012L=HWAN - No...ugh... please...
Speech_0013L=HWAN - Please... stop...
Speech_0014L=HWAN - I'm sorry...

[P_07_Battery_InteroCmdCenter]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=FISHER - You're boss is a pretty unhappy guy.
Speech_0004L=SHEN - Pl... please... I am a coward...
Speech_0005L=FISHER - That's apparent. Tell me something interesting and you have nothing to be afraid of.
Speech_0006L=SHEN - You're American... no doubt here because of the missile that sank your ship...
Speech_0007L=FISHER - Maybe.
Speech_0008L=SHEN - It was launched from here... but we didn't control the launch... I have no idea how it happened. I have a theory that the BIOS of the launcher might contain an digital remnant of whatever attack corrupted our systems.
Speech_0009L=FISHER - Thanks... that's what I wanted to know.
Speech_0010L=SHEN - I am ashamed. Kill me.
Speech_0011L=SHEN - I am a worthless cowardly lackey...

[P_07_Battery_InteroCmdCenter_01]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=FISHER - Don't panic.
Speech_0002L=JUNG - Fine.
Speech_0003L=FISHER - You're well trained.
Speech_0004L=JUNG - I am a loyal soldier of the North Korean Army.
Speech_0005L=FISHER - Congratulations. Give me some intelligence or you'll be pushin' up daisies in a cemetery full of guys just like you.
Speech_0006L=JUNG - I don't have any intelligence.
Speech_0007L=FISHER - Heh heh... you just called yourself stupid.
Speech_0008L=JUNG - I am not stupid. I am loyal.
Speech_0009L=FISHER - Boy... you're worse than a jar head.
Speech_0010L=JUNG - Do not compare me to a cowardly American marine!
Speech_0011L=FISHER - Tell me something useful or we're finished here.
Speech_0012L=JUNG - Death before dishonor.
Speech_0013L=FISHER - Boy, you grunts are all the same...
Speech_0014L=JUNG - Corporal. Jung Bo-Kwan
Speech_0015L=JUNG - 825-775-867

[P_07_Battery_InteroColonel]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=FISHER - Don't bother with the 'who are you' crap... we're too old for children's games.
Speech_0002L=KWAN - Rrr. Fine. What do you want American?
Speech_0003L=FISHER - This battery is on the logistics train down Kaesong-Munsan. What's the divisional strength?
Speech_0004L=KWAN - Why should I tell you? You'll kill me anyway?
Speech_0005L=FISHER - It's a game of position Colonel, and you've already lost. Do you need to condemn fifty thousand men as well?
Speech_0006L=KWAN - They'll be your men, American, not mine.
Speech_0007L=FISHER - They're not my men Colonel, and not yours either. They're just men. Husbands, fathers, sons. Same as you and I. Do they need to die for our mistakes?
Speech_0008L=KWAN - We have 8-1 force ratios against your Second Infantry Division in armor, artillery and infantry down the length of the approach.
Speech_0012L=FISHER - Eight to one?!
Speech_0013L=KWAN - You cannot win. Kaesong-Munsan will be the breach point and Seoul will fall inside of 72 hours.
Speech_0010L=KWAN - Old soldiers never die.
Speech_0011L=KWAN - Fit to serve. Fit to rest.

[P_07_Battery_InteroDorm_01]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=FISHER - How's the cafeteria food?
Speech_0004L=CHEN - My god... I knew it... the invasion has started... you've already got your army behind us...
Speech_0005L=FISHER - Yeah. No reason not to cooperate.
Speech_0006L=CHEN - I surrender.
Speech_0007L=FISHER - Fine. How many men do you have in the battery?
Speech_0008L=CHEN - We are only 40... you have us easily outnumbered.
Speech_0009L=FISHER - We sure do... outnumbered and surrounded.
Speech_0010L=CHEN - I know when I am beaten.
Speech_0011L=CHEN - I am practical. Not cowardly.

[P_07_Battery_InteroGarage]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=FISHER - Tell me something useful and I won't stuff your corpse inside one of these crates.
Speech_0002L=FENG - The door code to get through the offices is 1879.
Speech_0003L=FISHER - What... that's it? No resistance? No whining?
Speech_0004L=FENG - You're the one with the knife.
Speech_0005L=FISHER - Alright... well thanks for your time then.
Note_0009L=The key code for the shipping area door is 1879.
Speech_0006L=FENG - I told you, it's 1879.
Speech_0007L=FENG - Let me give you my wallet too.

[P_07_Battery_InteroLookout]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=FISHER - You know any Elvis?
Speech_0002L=JIN - Wh... how did you get here?
Speech_0003L=FISHER - You're spoiling the mood. I'm not here for chit-chat...
Speech_0004L=JIN - I'll shut up...
Speech_0005L=FISHER - Anything of interest up here?
Speech_0006L=JIN - We keep a repair log on the computer of there...
Speech_0007L=FISHER - I like repair logs...
Speech_0008L=JIN - Please... I'm just a scout...
Speech_0009L=JIN - I'm not evil... don't kill me...
Speech_0010L=JIN - I'm only here because I have good eyes.

[P_07_Battery_InteroMissileBay]
Note_0016L=An elevator connects the Command Center to the missile control room.
Note_0017L=The Base Commander can be found in the Command Center.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=FISHER - Keep quiet or  it's bad news...
Speech_0002L=MANCHU - Oh...god... please... I'll co-operate.
Speech_0003L=FISHER - Good... I'm looking for senior officers... a command center.
Speech_0004L=MANCHU - There's an elevator just there... it leads up to the command center. The Base Commander should be up there.
Speech_0005L=FISHER - Thanks
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0006L=FISHER - I heard there is a launch in progress...
Speech_0007L=MANCHU - Oh...god...
Speech_0008L=FISHER - I don't have time for you to freak out... where is the missile being launched from?
Speech_0009L=MANCHU - The East Battery... but you better hurry...
Speech_0010L=FISHER - Thanks for the tip.
Speech_0011L=MANCHU - Please... don't hurt me...
Speech_0012L=MANCHU - I didn't do anything wrong...

[P_07_Battery_InteroOffice]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=FISHER - Easy or hard?
Speech_0004L=DAK - Uh... uh... easy?
Speech_0005L=FISHER - Great... that works for me too. Tell me something I don't know, and then you can pretend you never saw me.
Speech_0006L=DAK - Uh... the door code into the storage area...?
Speech_0007L=FISHER - That would be wonderful.
Speech_0008L=DAK - 5871.
Speech_0009L=FISHER - You've been very helpful.
Speech_0011L=DAK - You are mighty... I am weak...
Speech_0012L=DAK - I hate my job...

[P_07_Battery_InteroOffice_01]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=FISHER - Working late?
Speech_0002L=BAE - Oh my god! An American Commando!
Speech_0003L=FISHER - Shh...
Speech_0004L=BAE - Please don't kill me... I love America! I love the U-S-A
Speech_0005L=FISHER - Quiet--
Speech_0006L=BAE - I love Britney... she's the best! Go Yankee's!
Speech_0007L=FISHER - Hey... calm down--
Speech_0008L=BAE - Chocolate ice cream...yaa! Ice cream. Hamburger's... mmm.
Speech_0009L=FISHER - Listen, I --
Speech_0010L=BAE - Nice home in the suburbs. Freedom and democracy!
Speech_0011L=FISHER - Shut up and--
Speech_0012L=BAE - Born to wild! Born to be free! Don't tread on me!
Speech_0013L=FISHER - Oh forget it...
Speech_0014L=BAE - God Bless America!
Speech_0015L=BAE - Take me out to the ball game!
Speech_0016L=BAE - Oh say can you see... by the dawn's early light...

[P_07_Battery_InteroWarehouse]
Note_0014L=Use the crane controls to move the missile and clear the path.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=FISHER - Imagine I wanted to open these big doors...
Speech_0002L=PING - My god... who are--
Speech_0003L=FISHER - I'm the Key-Master. You are the Gate-Keeper. 
Speech_0004L=PING - Oh... god... I... I don't know the code... we're not from this base... we just deliver the missile and wait for someone to sign...
Speech_0005L=FISHER - Hm... so how am I going to get through?
Speech_0006L=PING - You'll have to somehow climb through the shaft where the missile goes through...
Speech_0007L=FISHER - Good idea.
Speech_0008L=PING - A...anything to help...
Note_0012L=The only way into the missile bay is through the missile loading shaft.
Speech_0009L=PING - You'll probably have to move the missile first...
Speech_0010L=PING - I think the crane controls are in the control room over the loading bay.
Speech_0011L=PING - The controls are just over there... on the wall...

[P_07_Battery_InteroWarehouse_01]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=FISHER - What's in all the boxes?
Speech_0002L=DONG - My god... no.
Speech_0003L=FISHER - Yeah, yeah, shock and awe... just answer the question... what's in the boxes?
Speech_0004L=DONG - I swear... I don't know... it's just my job to guard the room.
Speech_0005L=FISHER - Fine... then tell me something you do know...
Speech_0006L=DONG - There is a hatch in the corner... it leads to the sub floor under the loading dock...
Speech_0007L=FISHER - Really?
Speech_0008L=DONG - I don't know any more.
Speech_0009L=DONG - Check the boxes for yourself I won't tell.

[P_07_Battery_Objectives]
Objective_0001=Determine if the Koreans intentionally launched the missile.
Objective_0026=Despite North Korean claims, satellite shows conclusively that the missile that sank the Walsh came from this battery. Check the Command Center to determine if it was intentional.
Objective_0006=Recover the shipping and repair logs.
Objective_0027=Recovering low level intelligence about shipping and repair duties from four unsecured computers will give Echelon's Analysts a better picture of NKA capabilities in the region.
Objective_0015=Tap the launcher BIOS for a fingerprint of Dvorak algorithm fragments.
Objective_0028=If the launch was forced it's possible that a Dvorak 'fingerprint' can be found on the BIOS of the West Battery launcher. Open the casing on the launcher itself to check.
Objective_0012=Tap the launcher BIOS for a fingerprint of Dvorak algorithm fragments.
Objective_0029=If the launch was forced it's possible that a Dvorak 'fingerprint' can be found on the BIOS of the West Battery launcher. Open the casing on the launcher itself to check.
Objective_0016=Stop the missile launch.
Objective_0030=War has broken out, and North Korea has authorized attacks against US targets at sea. Try to prevent a missile launch from the East Battery launcher.
Objective_0017=Acquire the missile abort codes.
Objective_0031=The missile is away. Get the abort codes from the launch command beneath the East Battery Launcher.
Objective_0018=Abort the missile.
Objective_0032=Take the abort codes to the East Missile Bay and use them to bypass the missile fusing authorization check.
Objective_0036=Stop the missile launch.
Objective_0037=War has broken out, and North Korea has authorized attacks against US targets at sea. Try to prevent a missile launch from the East Battery launcher.
Objective_0025=Determine North Koreas divisional strength down the Kaesong-Munsan approach.
Objective_0033=(null)
Objective_0024=Prime a missile in each of the missile bays.
Objective_0034=(null)
Objective_0019=Exfiltrate to any available extraction point.
Objective_0035=Exfiltrate over the side of the cliff from either launcher.
Speech_-001L=(null)
